{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25447","headline":"初归平泉过龙门南岭遥望山居即事 · 李德裕","name":"初归平泉过龙门南岭遥望山居即事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"初归故乡陌，极望且徐轮。\n近野樵蒸至，平泉烟火新。\n农夫馈鸡黍，渔子荐霜鳞。\n惆怅怀杨仆，惭爲关外人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25447.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25447","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}